  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "GraphHudComponent is a presentation layer component responsible for rendering dynamic Heads-Up Display (HUD) elements, such as badges for clusters and pills for nodes, overlaid on a knowledge graph visualization. It manages display state, handles user interactions like searching and focusing, and runs a continuous rendering loop using requestAnimationFrame. It consumes state from GraphStateService and relies on GraphViewportComponent for 3D-to-2D coordinate projections, integrating styling via GraphStyleService."
  },
